### Variables
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = demo-token

### 1. Health check (sin token)
GET {{host}}/salud

### 2. Listar sin token -> 401
GET {{host}}/v1/tareas

### 3. Crear tarea -> 201
POST {{host}}/v1/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titulo": "Preparar exposición" }

### 4. Crear tarea inválida (título muy corto) -> 422
POST {{host}}/v1/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titulo": "a" }

### 5. Listar tareas -> 200
GET {{host}}/v1/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Completar la tarea 1 -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/v1/tareas/1/completar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Completar una tarea que no existe -> 404
PATCH {{host}}/v1/tareas/9999/completar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
